s=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"pi\"></span> on both sides and then by subtracting, not dividing, 5 from both sides.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959621,"updateDate":1691007959621}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959621, 1691007959621),
