</math> degrees, it follows that the measure of angle&nbsp;<math alttext="upper X upper C upper B"><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math alttext="180 minus 90 minus 41"><mn>180</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>41</mn></math>, or <math alttext="49"><mn>49</mn>
