ten in the form <math alttext=\"3 StartRoot d EndRoot\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></math>, where <math alttext=\"d\"><mi>d</mi>\n</math> is an integer, what is the value of <math alttext=\"d\"><mi>d</mi>\n</math>?</p>","externalid":"ae6da77a-4de7-4375-a532-b00350663a9f","templateid":"77f527e1-cdb7-400b-98f2-f7f6edaf65b1","vaultid":"7ba59adb-5da7-4566-8128-5a589f398d0e","type":"spr","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["113"]},"createDate":1691007959840,"updateDate":1691007959840}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959840, 1691007959840),
