p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the solution to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"three oneths equals StartFraction 6 Over n EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"one third equals StartFraction 6 Over n EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the length of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"line segment upper T upper U\"><mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"line segment upper X upper Y\"><mover><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the sum of the length of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"line segment upper T upper U\"><mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> and the perimeter of triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper T upper U upper V\"><mi>T</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi></math>, not the length of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"line segment upper X upper Y\"><mover><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>.</p>","externalid":"b6420961-9ecc-40b1-9203-ca168e783426","correct_answer":["C"]},"createDate":1755117017723,"updateDate":1755117017723}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1755117017723, 1755117017723),
    ($SATQ$fc8aa563$SATQ$, $SATQ$af30d73b-01f0-4546-bd51-0d5af9b64d57$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Circles$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 4, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">What is the center of the circle in the <em>xy</em>-plane defined by the equation <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus 1 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y plus 7 right parenthesis squared equals 1"><mrow>
